  "package_id": "keller-klein-sharp-stability",
  "formal_scope": "Lean 4.19.0 proves, for actual finite signed coefficient vectors and their actual minimum signed sum, the inverse theorem with its equality classification, stability at every cap with an explicit admissible comparison vector and its optimality, the exact saturated modulus with its equality cases and attainment, the fixed-flat inequalities and the sharpness witnesses: 67 audited statements in 15 new modules, replayed with nine inherited modules and the 62 earlier modules. A conditional Lean bridge derives the four-shift envelope with the analytic tail inputs as hypotheses. The probability optima have conventional proofs using the Keller–Klein, Hollom–Portier and Tomaszewski inputs and validated interval certificates on 27,972 rational boxes.",
